RING ASSIGNMENTS - THE TEN RINGS OF AKATSUKI
Each ring bears an inscription and a fixed position on the summoned Gedo Statue's
hands during a sealing. All ten must be present (in person or by projection) for
a full extraction. Rings are not personal jewellery; they are sealing keys.

Rei (Zero) --- Pain --- right thumb
Byaku (White) --- Konan --- right middle
Shu (Vermilion) --- Itachi --- right ring
Nan (South) --- Kisame --- left ring
Sei (Blue/Green) --- Deidara --- right index
Gyoku (Jewel) --- Sasori, then Tobi --- left thumb
San (Three) --- Hidan --- left index
Hoku (North) --- Kakuzu --- left middle
Kai (Boundary) --- Zetsu --- right little
Kuu (Sky/Void) --- (vacant seat, formerly Orochimaru)

A missing bearer is projected in by chakra receiver. Guard your ring with your life.
